     ; The functor instances replay that same WP script over the functor
     ; body.  Measured 2026-08-29: P-256 runs 1 h 49 min and then fails,
     ; not times out -- the twelve blanket [discharge_fixed] rounds leave
     ; the FIRST call equation with an unresolved output evar and the
     ; guard fires, [Tactic failure: P3-CLOSURE-RESIDUAL (montmul ?x1
     ; (toZ wX1) (toZ wX2))].  More rounds do not help; the closure is
     ; not converging.  P-384/P-224 are the same script.  Nothing Requires
     ; them (only a comment in Theory/WordByWordMontgomery/RcbGeneralAChain.v
     ; mentions them), and the Rupicola route above already delivers the
     ; verified add/double for all three curves.
