     ; it as a hypothesis [HShiftScalar : spec_of_shift_scalar functions]
     ; for which NO compiled implementation exists anywhere in the tree,
     ; the only one being the cluster above.  Both are also unbuilt and
     ; were failing silently in the build.  wNAF_GLV_Func.v is the
     ; surviving route.
